 need to do this again."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:tamperWithDevice","text":["Dismount the gorilla on a holding area and tamper with the device to the north."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:useChiselOnOnyx","text":["Use a chisel on the charged onyx."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:useOnyxOnDevice","text":["Use the onyx back on the device."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:investigateIncubationChamber","text":["Investigate one of the incubation chambers in the room."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:talkToGarkorAfterLab","text":["Return to Garkor."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:talkToAwowAfterLab","text":["Talk to Awowogei."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:talkToGarkorAfterLabAgain","text":["Talk to Garkor again."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"}]},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:node:379","title":"Defending the tree","steps":[{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:talkToNarnodeAfterLab","text":["Talk to King Narnode Shareen in the Tree Gnome Stronghold. Be prepared for fighting, and bring 2 combat styles."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:talkToNieve","text":["Talk to Nieve south of the Grand Tree. Be prepared to fight with 2 combat styles."],"dialogue":["Talk about Monkey Madness II.","Yes."],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:killGorillasInStronghold","text":["Roam around with Nieve killing the gorillas within the Gnome Stronghold. If you lose Nieve, you can get her again from the Grand Tree."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:enterNorthOfTree","text":["Enter the breach north west of the Grand Tree with Nieve."],"dialogue":["Yes, let's go."],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:enterStrongholdCave","text":["Enter the cavern to the north east."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:killTorturedAndDemonic","text":["Talk to Glough in the north of the cavern. After, defeat the tortured and demonic gorillas."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:fightGlough","text":["Defeat Glough. He has 3 phases, changing rooms each time. You can safe spot the first 2 phases. Protect from Melee if you're next to him, or Protect from Magic if not in the third phase.","The easiest way to do phase 3 is to attack him from 1 tile away, have Protect from Magic on, and step away a tile whenever he pulls you closer."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:talkToZooknockToFinish","text":["Talk to Zooknock to teleport to the Grand Tree."],"dialogue":["Yes."],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:talkToNarnodeToFinish","text":["Talk to Narnode to finish the madness!"],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"main"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:enterNorthOfTreeNoNieve","text":["Enter the breach north west of the Grand Tree."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"related","parentId":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:fightGlough"}]},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:additional","title":"Additional source instructions and alternatives","steps":[{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:field:pickUpGreegree","text":["Pick up your greegree!"],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"related"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:node:461","text":["Go up the rope to the west."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"related"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:node:466","text":["Go up the rope to the west."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"related"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:node:470","text":["Climb up the rope to the south east and use Protect from Ranged."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"related"},{"id":"MONKEY_MADNESS_II:node:475","text":["Climb up the rope to the north west and use Protect from Melee."],"dialogue":[],"sourcePath":"src/main/java/com/questhelper/helpers/quests/monkeymadnessii/MonkeyMadnessII.java","role":"related"},